WEBVTT

00:23.830 --> 00:25.250
I swear,

00:25.250 --> 00:29.290
these Republican spies are such pushovers.

00:41.130 --> 00:44.000
But this guy will be different...

00:50.040 --> 00:51.380
Ten days go by fast...

00:51.750 --> 00:53.830
Teach, you're back!

00:53.830 --> 00:55.130
I haven't seen you in forever!

00:55.420 --> 00:57.380
Nor I you.

00:57.380 --> 01:00.210
You were off vacationing in the Lylat Kingdom, right?

01:00.210 --> 01:01.250
You lucky dog.

01:01.250 --> 01:03.670
I hear their seafood is to die for.

01:03.920 --> 01:05.750
I had a pretty good time.

01:05.750 --> 01:06.880
How was your break?

01:06.880 --> 01:09.080
Oh, it was a blast.

01:09.080 --> 01:12.130
And I bought souvenirs,
so you should come over to the dining room!

01:13.250 --> 01:16.920
I timed the food to be ready
right when you got back.

01:16.920 --> 01:19.330
I hope you like it.

01:21.210 --> 01:22.830
That does smell nice.

01:23.580 --> 01:25.580
By the way, where are the others?

01:26.710 --> 01:28.790
They haven't gotten back from their vacations yet.

01:28.790 --> 01:31.210
Slackers, the lot of 'em.

01:39.000 --> 01:40.880
Of course, that was all a load of lies.

01:45.580 --> 01:46.580
Figures.

01:54.290 --> 01:57.040
Damn it, I figured that even the mighty
Klaus would let his guard down

01:57.040 --> 01:58.670
after having just come back from a vacation.

01:58.670 --> 02:01.630
It'll take more than that to make
a first-rate spy slip up.

02:02.000 --> 02:04.460
You've improved a lot,
but you still have a long way to go.

02:04.710 --> 02:07.460
If you're gonna browbeat us,
at least teach us how to do it right next time!

02:07.460 --> 02:09.040
Conduct your surprise attacks floatily.

02:09.040 --> 02:10.040
That concludes the lesson.

02:10.040 --> 02:12.380
You haven't improved one bit, Teach!

02:12.710 --> 02:15.710
Still, your enthusiasm came across loud and clear.

02:15.710 --> 02:16.710
Magnificent.

02:16.880 --> 02:19.040
We're all fired up and ready to go.

02:19.040 --> 02:23.580
After all, Lamplight's been promoted from a
provisional team to an actual team.

02:23.580 --> 02:26.420
I'm ready to do my best on our first official mission!

02:26.420 --> 02:28.460
I've got all my ducks in a row, yo!

02:28.630 --> 02:31.130
It's time for us to put our unity to the test!

02:32.130 --> 02:34.130
Your passion is all well and good

02:34.710 --> 02:36.250
but our first official mission is already done.

02:37.130 --> 02:38.920
I finished three missions in the Lylat Kingdom,

02:38.920 --> 02:40.290
as well as another two domestically.

02:40.500 --> 02:44.170
The next mission's going to be our sixth one.

02:45.830 --> 02:49.460
What the heck?!

03:08.580 --> 03:13.080
<b>SPY CLASSROOM</b>

04:19.710 --> 04:26.330
<b>MISSION: Daughter Dearest I</b>

04:23.290 --> 04:25.130
You completed these on your own?

04:25.130 --> 04:26.330
In that tiny time frame?

04:26.670 --> 04:27.920
I find that hard to believe,

04:27.920 --> 04:29.670
but I guess I should know better than to doubt you.

04:32.540 --> 04:35.880
That said, we went out of our way to get
the girls formally registered.

04:36.170 --> 04:38.710
Why didn't you bring them with you to Lylat?

04:38.710 --> 04:40.080
They need more training.

04:40.210 --> 04:42.210
They're talented, I'll give them that.

04:42.830 --> 04:44.880
But they aren't ready yet.

04:45.210 --> 04:47.750
The only reason I brought them along
last time was because

04:47.750 --> 04:49.080
it was the only way I could fool Guido.

04:49.080 --> 04:52.790
At this rate, you'll end up leaving them
rotting on the bench for years.

04:53.000 --> 04:54.880
You act like that's a foregone conclusion.

04:55.040 --> 04:57.130
It's a mistake you seem all too liable to make.

04:57.330 --> 04:59.250
I'd like to take a sabbatical from missions for a while.

04:59.710 --> 05:02.210
Surely that last set I completed must have
bought us some breathing room.

05:02.210 --> 05:04.130
I want to gather up whatever intel I can on Serpent.

05:06.250 --> 05:08.830
You know full well that that isn't an option.

05:09.330 --> 05:11.250
Even as we speak,

05:11.250 --> 05:15.670
the Empire is defiling our borders by
sending villainous spies across them.

05:16.210 --> 05:20.330
Stopping them is costing our countrymen their lives.

05:20.630 --> 05:24.880
Losing Inferno cost our nation dearly.

05:26.420 --> 05:30.250
In particular, this mission is one
that only you can complete.

05:36.710 --> 05:38.210
You're refusing to do it?

05:39.170 --> 05:40.460
I memorized the whole thing.

05:41.000 --> 05:42.670
What choice do I have but to accept it?

05:43.290 --> 05:45.920
It's the only way I can protect the masses
that Inferno so loved.

05:55.580 --> 05:57.750
I brought you some tea, Boss.

05:58.040 --> 06:01.170
As I've told you a million times,
please stop calling me that.

06:02.920 --> 06:04.330
Those are some excellent leaves.

06:04.330 --> 06:05.540
They must have been expensive.

06:05.670 --> 06:08.580
Their fragrance caught my attention
while I was out on vacation.

06:09.210 --> 06:11.420
I didn't want to serve you anything but the best.

06:12.580 --> 06:13.830
<i>I don't get it.</i>

06:14.420 --> 06:17.210
<i>What did I do to inspire such affection from her?</i>

06:28.630 --> 06:29.960
How beautiful.

06:31.250 --> 06:33.040
This was a bold attempt at seduction.

06:33.290 --> 06:35.380
I commend your bravery.

06:39.380 --> 06:40.380
Boss...

06:43.080 --> 06:44.330
Is that not what this is?

06:45.040 --> 06:46.250
Forgive me.

06:49.380 --> 06:51.080
<i>Looking back, it still doesn't make sense.</i>

06:51.080 --> 06:52.670
<i>I didn't do anything to deserve such fondness.</i>

06:54.880 --> 06:57.380
You didn't make it back until quite late today.

06:57.790 --> 06:59.670
Do you think you'll be able to take it easier tomorrow?

06:59.670 --> 07:00.960
It's unlikely.

07:01.290 --> 07:03.040
I just took on a big mission,

07:03.040 --> 07:05.330
and I got ordered to rewrite my mission reports, too.

07:06.420 --> 07:09.380
When I wrote, "Somehow or other, I got it done,"

07:09.380 --> 07:10.750
I got told to quit screwing around.

07:15.540 --> 07:16.630
Boss...

07:16.630 --> 07:17.790
Yes?

07:17.790 --> 07:20.540
If it's all right with you,
I'd like to hold you to my bosom.

07:22.580 --> 07:23.960
Why would that be all right with me?

07:23.960 --> 07:25.710
There's no need to be so bashful.

07:26.250 --> 07:28.790
Please, don't hesitate to let me dote on you.

07:29.080 --> 07:31.830
Just for the record,
is this you practicing your seduction?

07:31.830 --> 07:32.830
Oh no!

07:32.830 --> 07:35.080
Boss, I promise I'm not trying to deceive you here.

07:35.380 --> 07:37.500
All I want is for you to take a break.

07:37.500 --> 07:38.630
What?

07:38.630 --> 07:42.880
We succeeded in the last Impossible Mission
largely on the back of your efforts.

07:43.210 --> 07:44.920
And even now,

07:44.920 --> 07:50.210
you're completing missions, doing admin work,
and teaching us all on your own.

07:50.630 --> 07:52.330
I appreciate the concern,

07:52.330 --> 07:54.330
but you should just be focusing on your training.

07:54.920 --> 07:56.920
For now, that means attacking me.

07:57.880 --> 07:59.420
You mean, you want me to make a move on you?!

07:59.580 --> 08:01.080
Grete,

08:01.080 --> 08:04.670
the next time you come to my room,
you had better bring one of the others along with you.

08:04.670 --> 08:06.880
B-but that's bigamy!

08:10.000 --> 08:12.920
Thea must have been putting
ideas in her head again.

08:13.210 --> 08:14.580
I feel oddly tired.

08:16.880 --> 08:18.290
I guess the fatigue's catching up to me.

08:22.960 --> 08:25.630
Make sure you protect 'em this time.

08:26.210 --> 08:27.830
I don't have time to spend worrying about myself.

08:28.500 --> 08:31.040
I need to prioritize the girls' safety.

08:33.380 --> 08:34.750
An assassin hunt,

08:34.750 --> 08:36.630
that's your next mission.

08:36.790 --> 08:40.960
Politicians from anti-Imperial parties
across the world have been dying left and right.

08:41.290 --> 08:43.670
They leave notes intimating they've committed suicide,

08:43.670 --> 08:45.630
but odds of the notes being forgeries are high.

08:45.630 --> 08:47.670
An assassin named Corpse,

08:47.960 --> 08:49.670
who resembles a cadaver...

08:50.460 --> 08:51.830
You're saying this is their handiwork?

08:51.830 --> 08:53.580
That's right, two weeks ago,

08:53.580 --> 08:56.460
a politician jumped to their death right here in Din.

08:56.460 --> 08:58.000
In all likelihood, that too was Corpse's doing.

08:58.630 --> 09:01.210
Our agent who got ahold of that intel was killed.

09:01.210 --> 09:03.380
Everyone we sent to take over for them was killed, too.

09:04.040 --> 09:06.960
In short, it's been classified as an Impossible Mission.

09:07.290 --> 09:11.420
It sounds like this is going to be even harder
than the last Impossible Mission.

09:11.830 --> 09:15.670
As you're aware, the Empire knows your personal intel.

09:15.670 --> 09:19.920
If you make any overt moves,
Corpse will likely go to ground.

09:20.750 --> 09:22.790
Take the girls along with you.

09:22.790 --> 09:24.330
You won't be able to do this one alone.

09:24.750 --> 09:27.880
<i>But if I do that, Corpse could easily kill them.</i>

09:28.420 --> 09:30.500
<i>I need to handle this one on my own.</i>

09:31.880 --> 09:35.210
Before you get into it, though,
I have another mission I need you to handle.

09:37.130 --> 09:38.790
That scheming codger...

09:44.040 --> 09:46.000
That didn't even make for decent sport.

09:55.880 --> 09:57.580
I take it this was you, Lily?

09:58.330 --> 09:59.330
Y-you spotted it?

09:59.960 --> 10:02.960
But I set the trap so you'd run into it
after you let your guard down.

10:03.670 --> 10:05.080
It was too obvious a trick.

10:05.330 --> 10:07.630
Skilled spies are sensitive to hostility.

10:08.040 --> 10:11.630
Even someone a fair bit weaker than me
would have sensed it.

10:12.380 --> 10:15.290
Dang, and I thought I'd come so far.

10:15.380 --> 10:18.130
Have you at least stopped forgetting
to carry your antidote?

10:18.920 --> 10:21.750
I'll have you know that I remember it
nine times out of ten these days!

10:21.750 --> 10:23.290
That's still not great.

10:24.920 --> 10:26.880
Actually, while I have you, could you follow me?

10:27.170 --> 10:28.380
Huh? What for?

10:28.380 --> 10:30.750
Wait, you're just going to leave us here?!

10:33.960 --> 10:35.960
Ooh, is this one of those joyride dates

10:35.960 --> 10:36.790
Do you all want to participate in missions?
I've heard so much about?<b></b>

10:36.790 --> 10:38.380
Do you all want to participate in missions?

10:39.380 --> 10:41.210
I'm just asking for reference.

10:41.540 --> 10:43.710
Of course we want in.

10:44.250 --> 10:47.080
With the big caveat that we really
don't want to die, mind you.

10:47.080 --> 10:49.540
We've all be putting a lot into our training.

10:49.790 --> 10:54.250
I want to become a spy feared the world over
and have loads of people fawn over me.

10:54.250 --> 10:55.250
I see.

10:55.250 --> 10:58.290
And plus, we make less money if we're not working.

10:58.290 --> 11:00.130
You don't have anything to worry about on that front.

11:00.130 --> 11:02.000
Even when I complete the missions solo,

11:02.000 --> 11:04.130
I've been splitting the completion bonuses
evenly with the team.

11:05.130 --> 11:08.330
In that case, I'm totally down to keep playing hooky-

11:09.000 --> 11:11.790
What happened to wanting to be fawned over?

11:11.790 --> 11:16.170
If I can make loads of money, get treated
like an expert spy, and be revered

11:16.170 --> 11:18.500
all for doing nothing and sleeping in,
that's basically the dream!

11:18.500 --> 11:20.210
You're letting your greed show.

11:21.170 --> 11:26.250
But if that's not an option,
then I really do want to take on missions.

11:28.250 --> 11:30.210
We're still spies, you know.

11:30.210 --> 11:31.790
All of us want to change the world.

11:34.210 --> 11:35.420
Magnificent.

11:36.380 --> 11:38.580
We'll continue this conversation
after the mission's over.

11:38.580 --> 11:41.040
Wait, I get to join in on an operation already?

11:41.040 --> 11:42.250
That's right.

11:42.580 --> 11:44.540
I need you to spend an hour walking around town,

11:44.540 --> 11:46.830
then buy some drinks and come back to the car.

11:47.080 --> 11:48.130
Roger that.

11:48.130 --> 11:49.540
Then what?

11:49.540 --> 11:50.750
Then, we go home.

11:51.170 --> 11:54.170
I can deal with the target on my own.

11:54.170 --> 11:56.920
That's not a mission, that's just a shopping trip!

12:03.880 --> 12:05.420
Ah, I've been expecting you.

12:05.420 --> 12:06.630
Come on in.

12:13.500 --> 12:15.960
Do you have any collaborators in the city?

12:18.420 --> 12:19.750
You don't.

12:19.880 --> 12:21.380
That's a relief.

12:21.630 --> 12:23.790
How did you know I was coming?

12:25.250 --> 12:26.460
If I had to guess...

12:37.750 --> 12:41.080
All that's left is to head back
and write up my report.

12:50.580 --> 12:51.830
A blown tire?

12:52.250 --> 12:54.630
But I'm sure what I heard was a gunshot.

13:06.960 --> 13:10.420
<b>MISSION: Daughter Dearest I</b>

13:12.500 --> 13:13.500
Lily!

13:14.380 --> 13:16.500
I'm fine, Teach!

13:16.500 --> 13:19.130
Go west! It was a man in a beige coat!

13:19.130 --> 13:20.330
Got it.

13:22.460 --> 13:24.040
<i>Did he have allies after all?</i>

13:24.040 --> 13:25.290
<i>I screwed up.</i>

13:35.040 --> 13:36.380
He got away?

13:37.210 --> 13:39.420
No, something is off.

13:41.920 --> 13:43.130
Oh hey, Teach.

13:43.130 --> 13:44.420
What happened to the bad guy?

13:44.420 --> 13:45.460
I'm sorry.

13:45.460 --> 13:46.670
He gave me the slip.

13:46.670 --> 13:48.170
Wait, he really lost you?

13:48.170 --> 13:50.330
What, feeling disillusioned?

13:50.580 --> 13:51.580
No, no.

13:51.580 --> 13:54.630
It's just, you sounded so confident
when you went after him,

13:54.630 --> 13:55.920
so I'm a little surprised.

13:56.130 --> 13:57.460
I did?

13:57.920 --> 13:59.880
Well, we can worry about the attack later.

13:59.880 --> 14:01.630
For now, we need to get that arm treated.

14:01.630 --> 14:03.080
Ah, right.

14:04.330 --> 14:05.540
Here ya go!

14:07.500 --> 14:08.710
Why...

14:08.710 --> 14:10.250
I'm just following your orders.

14:10.250 --> 14:11.670
"Put on that bandage,

14:11.670 --> 14:15.710
and once I get back, stab me with your poison
needle to numb my pain," you said.

14:15.710 --> 14:17.130
What pain?

14:17.130 --> 14:20.170
I mean, your arm was bleeding all over place.

14:20.170 --> 14:21.380
My arm?

14:21.380 --> 14:22.670
But that doesn't make any sense.

14:24.750 --> 14:25.960
Magnificent.

14:26.920 --> 14:28.420
There were two of each of us.

14:28.790 --> 14:31.790
In other words, the wounded Lily I saw at first

14:31.790 --> 14:34.880
and the Lily who stabbed me when I came back
were two different people.

14:35.290 --> 14:38.580
And the me who ordered you to stab me

14:38.580 --> 14:41.290
and the me you actually stabbed with your needle
were different people as well.

14:41.460 --> 14:42.830
What's going on?

14:42.920 --> 14:44.580
It's a trick based around disguises.

14:45.040 --> 14:47.960
And there's only one person that could
pull a stunt like that off.

14:47.960 --> 14:49.460
Just as I expected.

14:53.250 --> 14:54.630
Whaaat?

14:55.630 --> 14:57.580
You're sensitive to traps, Boss.

14:58.000 --> 15:00.960
You always pick up on our malice and hostility.

15:01.210 --> 15:05.710
That's why I tricked Lily and got her
to stab you out of goodwill.

15:08.460 --> 15:10.380
I'm code name Daughter Dearest.

15:10.380 --> 15:12.630
Now, let's fill this time with laughter and tears.

15:13.460 --> 15:14.790
I just nicked it.

15:15.210 --> 15:17.210
If you're lookin' for Lily's antidote,
I've got it right here.

15:17.210 --> 15:18.670
Huh? But when?!

15:19.580 --> 15:21.830
I never thought it'd go so smooth.

15:21.920 --> 15:25.040
It stings to admit,
but Grete's plans really are top-notch.

15:25.130 --> 15:27.040
I was blown away, yo.

15:27.040 --> 15:29.790
Uh, and why wasn't I told any of this?

15:30.000 --> 15:31.420
If we let you know ahead of time,

15:31.420 --> 15:33.420
that information would have
made its way to the boss.

15:33.830 --> 15:36.170
Yeah, I guess I can't really argue with that.

15:36.750 --> 15:38.630
We finally cornered you.

15:38.880 --> 15:41.210
There's something quite enchanting about
seeing you down on your hands and knees.

15:41.210 --> 15:45.330
I never knew you had such a sadistic side to you.

15:45.630 --> 15:46.830
Boss...

15:47.080 --> 15:48.960
You've been pushing yourself too hard.

15:49.540 --> 15:51.170
If you were in peak form,

15:51.170 --> 15:54.830
you would have seen through my disguise
the moment you saw Lily injured like that.

15:55.750 --> 15:59.170
You've accomplished a lot since losing Inferno.

15:59.500 --> 16:04.750
Even just now, you worked through your vacation
to make up for our inexperience.

16:04.750 --> 16:06.170
That sounds about right.

16:06.380 --> 16:09.170
When was the last time you took a proper day off?

16:09.420 --> 16:11.380
Four hundred and sixty-five days ago.

16:13.500 --> 16:14.880
You're being rash.

16:14.880 --> 16:17.670
A schedule like that would have had anyone else
coughing up blood and keeling over by now.

16:17.670 --> 16:20.000
We want you to rely on us more.

16:20.000 --> 16:22.250
We want you to be able to rest easy.

16:22.580 --> 16:25.670
You don't have to bear it all on your own.

16:25.670 --> 16:27.130
You have us now.

16:29.920 --> 16:32.210
Now, about that surrender declaration...

16:33.750 --> 16:36.000
I understand how you feel.

16:37.170 --> 16:38.170
That's wonderful!

16:38.170 --> 16:39.960
You're right, I am exhausted.

16:40.580 --> 16:43.130
I'm tired to the bone.

16:43.130 --> 16:44.380
Exactly, and that's why-

16:44.380 --> 16:45.710
But the question is,

16:45.710 --> 16:48.750
how much longer should I keep
playing along with this game?

16:53.630 --> 16:54.830
Magnificent.

16:55.540 --> 16:58.790
That poison needle devoid of malice
was a thing of beauty.

16:58.790 --> 17:00.880
I applaud the ingenuity.

17:01.130 --> 17:03.000
Isn't he supposed to be poisoned?

17:03.000 --> 17:07.210
Sorry, I wasn't able to get a clean hit.

17:07.670 --> 17:10.830
I scratched him, so I was able to
poison him a little bit, but that was it.

17:11.130 --> 17:12.330
But how?

17:12.540 --> 17:14.540
There's no way you should have been able
to predict the attack.

17:14.540 --> 17:15.790
Sure there was.

17:15.790 --> 17:18.630
Your goodwill attack was effective,
don't get me wrong.

17:18.790 --> 17:22.210
But with how suspicious the leadup was,

17:22.210 --> 17:23.500
I was already on high alert.

17:26.250 --> 17:27.750
How did you see it coming?

17:27.750 --> 17:29.710
The way you cleared the area was too blatant.

17:30.500 --> 17:34.710
You distracted the cops and civilians from the gunshot
by covering it up with a popped tire.

17:35.330 --> 17:37.290
It was too well-executed to just be a coincidence.

17:37.790 --> 17:39.290
I could tell it was a trap

17:39.290 --> 17:42.460
designed to catch someone who could recognize
the difference between the two sounds.

17:43.830 --> 17:45.830
Once I realized I was clearly being baited,

17:45.830 --> 17:47.330
it made me be cautious.

17:47.630 --> 17:50.330
The spy I caught today had a similar realization.

17:50.960 --> 17:55.880
When he discovered that both his neighbors had gone
on vacation at the same time, he got suspicious.

17:56.540 --> 18:00.380
Our Foreign Intelligence Office did
a sloppy job clearing the area.

18:01.040 --> 18:03.880
You all have magnificent talents,

18:04.290 --> 18:05.830
and someday, they'll come into bloom.

18:05.830 --> 18:08.250
At present, though, you don't have what it takes.

18:08.500 --> 18:13.460
If I'd delegated today's mission to you,
you would have gotten killed.

18:14.420 --> 18:16.830
I can't afford to rely on you.

18:24.830 --> 18:27.580
I thought I was doing a better job
gauging my own stamina.

18:28.710 --> 18:29.920
This is pathetic.

18:31.000 --> 18:32.830
I don't have my Inferno teammates anymore.

18:33.210 --> 18:35.040
I have to keep this up,

18:35.040 --> 18:37.330
no matter how much it eats away at me...

18:44.130 --> 18:45.330
Grete...

18:45.790 --> 18:49.420
I took the liberty of making you some
herbal tea to help you sleep,

18:49.420 --> 18:51.460
but I fear I ended up waking you up instead.

18:51.710 --> 18:53.250
Don't worry about it.

18:53.580 --> 18:57.040
Thank you for taking part in
our training exercise this afternoon.

18:57.630 --> 18:59.880
We just finished up our postmortem.

19:00.210 --> 19:03.750
Now, once you exchange an embrace with me,
the day will be perfect.

19:03.750 --> 19:05.380
I'm going to ask you this straight.

19:07.580 --> 19:10.210
Are you in love with me?

19:13.250 --> 19:14.920
N-nothing gets past you, Boss.

19:14.920 --> 19:16.960
I'm impressed you noticed.

19:16.960 --> 19:19.040
You were trying to hide it?

19:20.380 --> 19:22.500
Grete, as far as your feelings go, I-

19:22.500 --> 19:23.710
Please...

19:25.750 --> 19:27.210
don't give me your answer yet.

19:27.380 --> 19:30.290
My heart isn't ready.

19:30.960 --> 19:33.250
I'd really like to make my position clear.

19:33.250 --> 19:34.460
But...

19:39.830 --> 19:41.040
Forgive me.

19:41.040 --> 19:42.960
Another time, then.

19:43.460 --> 19:44.830
Thank you for that.

19:45.380 --> 19:49.710
Could I at least give you this report for
the mission you completed today?

19:50.330 --> 19:51.880
You ghostwrote it for me?

19:51.920 --> 19:52.920
I did.

19:52.920 --> 19:56.290
I figured that if I observed you,
I could at least write down the parts I saw.

19:56.460 --> 20:00.250
Ah, so I had a guardian angel that whole time.

20:00.630 --> 20:02.250
Does this make you want to let me dote on you?

20:02.250 --> 20:05.040
I'm going to ignore that question,
but I really do appreciate it.

20:05.040 --> 20:06.250
Thank you.

20:12.210 --> 20:13.420
Wait, hold on.

20:14.460 --> 20:17.250
I didn't tell a soul about my mission today,

20:17.250 --> 20:20.500
and when I chose to take Lily along,
it was a spur-of-the-moment whim.

20:22.250 --> 20:25.040
Yet in spite of that, you observed
the whole thing from start to finish

20:25.040 --> 20:27.500
while still finding time to lead the others

20:27.500 --> 20:29.630
and set the stage for them to launch an attack on me.

20:30.500 --> 20:32.080
The timeline was too fast.

20:32.580 --> 20:34.790
When did you have time to come up with that plan?

20:35.040 --> 20:36.420
That's a fair question.

20:36.920 --> 20:39.830
It's true that I didn't know about your mission,

20:40.500 --> 20:43.460
so once I noticed that the homing device
I planted on Lily started moving,

20:43.460 --> 20:46.130
the amount of time I spent after
predicting your destination,

20:46.130 --> 20:49.000
catching a train, and figuring out the situation...

20:50.420 --> 20:51.630
was two seconds.

20:51.630 --> 20:54.670
That's how long the plan took me to put together.

20:56.830 --> 20:58.830
It's really nothing all that praiseworthy.

20:59.250 --> 21:00.460
All I did was take one

21:00.460 --> 21:03.580
of the hundreds and thousands of mental simulations
I ran in advance and put it to the test.

21:03.580 --> 21:05.040
You really went that far?

21:05.210 --> 21:06.420
Of course.

21:07.130 --> 21:11.710
The man I care about is running himself ragged
and refusing to accept my help.

21:12.420 --> 21:14.040
I can't help but feel frustrated.

21:14.460 --> 21:18.130
My powerlessness is making me
a burden for my beloved.

21:21.580 --> 21:25.500
Grete, I've never once thought of you as a burden.

21:27.460 --> 21:29.080
I'm going on an assassin hunt.

21:29.380 --> 21:30.880
That's the next mission.

21:33.630 --> 21:36.460
Will you lend me your strength, Grete?

21:36.790 --> 21:38.040
I need you.

21:40.500 --> 21:42.040
Could that be...

21:42.250 --> 21:43.250
What?

21:43.330 --> 21:44.710
...a proposal?

21:44.710 --> 21:45.920
It was not.

21:46.170 --> 21:47.460
I was joking.

21:47.460 --> 21:49.000
It would be my pleasure to help.

21:49.540 --> 21:53.170
I would do anything to assist you
and the team you built.

21:54.000 --> 21:55.210
Magnificent.

21:56.790 --> 21:58.130
Just as I expected.

21:59.830 --> 22:02.540
For this mission, I need to select some members.

22:02.540 --> 22:03.750
What do you mean?

22:04.290 --> 22:05.790
I'm going to take the assassin on

22:05.790 --> 22:09.540
with Lamplight's four strongest members by my side.
